Brother, brother, come down, come...

457
00:45:13,000 --> 00:45:18,000
Erê welle maşallah dengê te pir xweş kîbar e. Saetên te
gelek xweş.
 
Yes, by God, mashallah, your voice is very beautiful and
elegant. Your hours are very good.

458
00:45:18,000 --> 00:45:22,000
Li vê derê jî emkê teb'an qehwe... istirahek biçûk emkê
bibin.
 
Here we will naturally have coffee... we will take a small
rest.

459
00:45:22,000 --> 00:45:25,000
Erê ev der nû li vê derê em Olcîya... cem xwelîya min.
 
Yes, this place now, here we are at Olciya... near my sand.

460
00:45:25,000 --> 00:45:29,000
Teb'an emkê istiraheka biçûk bibin. Em gihîştin dawîya
vîdyoya xwe.
 
Naturally, we will take a small rest. We have reached the
end of our video.

461
00:45:29,000 --> 00:45:33,000
Saetên we gih û xweş. Silavên me jî ji we re hene.
 
May your hours be happy and good. Our greetings to you too.

462
00:45:33,000 --> 00:45:35,000
Çavê we maç dikim. Xwedê ji we razî be.
 
I kiss your eyes. May God be pleased with you.

463
00:45:35,000 --> 00:45:37,000
Bimînin di xweşîyê da.
 
Stay in happiness.

464
00:45:37,000 --> 00:45:41,000
Vîdyoyekî din xweş kîbar. Emê werin inşallah nêzîk da daxin.
 
Another beautiful, elegant video. We will come, God willing,
and upload it soon.

465
00:45:41,000 --> 00:45:43,000
Teb'an vîdyo me gelek efewî ne.
 
Naturally, our videos are very spontaneous.

466
00:45:43,000 --> 00:45:46,000
Gund jî gundê... xwezaya tebîeta vî gundî wena ne.
 
The village is also a village of... the nature of this
village is like this.

467
00:45:46,000 --> 00:45:49,000
Teqsîr meqsîr jî hebin hûnê pir qisûra me efû kin.
 
If there are any shortcomings, you will forgive our many
faults.

468
00:45:49,000 --> 00:45:54,000
Bimînin, dîsa vîdyoyekî xweş kîbar. Saeta we xweş. Bay bay.
 
Stay tuned, again for a beautiful elegant video. Have a good
time. Bye bye.

